```{=html}
<div class="lec-grid list">
<% for (const item of items) { const num = String(item.lecture).padStart(2, '0'); %>
<article class="lec-card" data-cats="<%= item.topics || '' %>" <%= metadataAttrs(item) %>>
  <div class="lec-card-top">
    <span class="lec-card-num" aria-hidden="true"><%= num %></span>
    <span class="lec-card-cat"><%= item.category %></span>
  </div>
  <h3><a href="<%- item.path %>"><span class="visually-hidden">Lecture <%= num %>: </span><%= item.title %></a></h3>
  <p><%= item.description %></p>
  <div class="lec-card-actions">
    <a class="lec-view" href="<%- item.path %>" aria-label="View lecture <%= num %>">View lecture &rarr;</a>
    <a class="lec-open" href="<%- item['slides-url'] %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Open slides for lecture <%= num %> on Google Drive (new tab)">Open slides &nearr;</a>
  </div>
</article>
<% } %>
</div>
```
